{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, loot, and craft to survive in this top-down extraction shooter. Explore procedurally generated neighborhoods. Scavenge for guns, food, and supplies. Build and upgrade your base to sustain you and your fellow survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build up your safe house</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/a1c90ec88621f31c29178fb34ed2a9ef.poster.avif?t=1757564270\" width=616 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/a1c90ec88621f31c29178fb34ed2a9ef.webm?t=1757564270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/a1c90ec88621f31c29178fb34ed2a9ef.mp4?t=1757564270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hundreds of zombies in real-time!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/34d2602d63eca62dcd16337a736ace42.poster.avif?t=1757564270\" width=590 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/34d2602d63eca62dcd16337a736ace42.webm?t=1757564270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/34d2602d63eca62dcd16337a736ace42.mp4?t=1757564270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grid-Based Inventory System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/3cce2420c4f536662f4a9b9730575e17.poster.avif?t=1757564270\" width=592 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/3cce2420c4f536662f4a9b9730575e17.webm?t=1757564270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/3cce2420c4f536662f4a9b9730575e17.mp4?t=1757564270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic LOS / Fog of war system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/ccf16657a4b95750e66f0795cb25bde4.poster.avif?t=1757564270\" width=590 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/ccf16657a4b95750e66f0795cb25bde4.webm?t=1757564270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/ccf16657a4b95750e66f0795cb25bde4.mp4?t=1757564270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural generation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/19935e3c70b1cafd6db1cadc2a6aa672.poster.avif?t=1757564270\" width=590 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/19935e3c70b1cafd6db1cadc2a6aa672.webm?t=1757564270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/19935e3c70b1cafd6db1cadc2a6aa672.mp4?t=1757564270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Realtime generation is shown for demonstration purposes. Procedural generation will be performed during loading. </i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Highlights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight or Evade enemy raiders and massive hordes of zombies   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The high-stakes inventory and gear system means you won't be just taking in stuff willy-nilly. Whatever you do take, be prepared to lose it all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > At home, survivors you save will be working on tasks you assign them while you go out and collect supplies. Consider taking a couple with you, assuming they know how to use a gun. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedural Neighborhood\u00a0 &amp; House Generation   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stat system - Manage Hunger, thirst, boredom, exhaustion </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Homebase system - Upgrade your base with supplies you bring home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Combat system - Melee and guns </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gun attachment system  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mod Support  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.poster.avif?t=1757564270\" width=320 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.webm?t=1757564270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.mp4?t=1757564270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2360880?t=1757564270","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st